\newlabel{fig:ksweep}{{3}{7}{Nepali/English premium on FLORES-200 devtest after adding $K$ merges by continued BPE, under the letters-only regex (\RI {}) and the repaired regex (\RII {}). Dashed lines: pre-token floors under each model's own pattern ($2.19$ and $2.17$ letters-only; $0.79$ and $0.80$ repaired, for Llama-3 and Qwen3). 95\% paired-bootstrap intervals (half-width at most 0.03) are narrower than the markers.\relax }{figure.caption.21}{}}
